---
title: Zolto Full Feature Showcase — Phase 10
author: Zolto Architecture Team
version: 10.0.0
---

@var engine = Zolto
@var phase  = 10

# {{engine}} Phase {{phase}} Full Showcase

> [!NOTE]
> Zolto is a strict superset of standard Markdown with native Mathematics, Diagrams, Charts, Vector Graphics, Spatial Layouts, Reusable Components, and Interactive Documents — built with Zero External Dependencies.

---

## 1. Native Spatial Layout Engine (Phase 8)

@layout width=100% padding=24 gap=20 theme="dark"
  @header
    ### Responsive Dashboard Layout
  @/header

  @grid columns=12 gap=16
    @cell span=8
      @flex direction="column" gap=12
        @item
          @card title="Main Overview" variant="info"
            Welcome to the Zolto Spatial Layout Engine showcase.
          @/card
        @/item
      @/flex
    @/cell

    @cell span=4
      @stack mode="overlay"
        @item z=1
          @card title="System Metric"
            CPUs: 99.8% Nominal
          @/card
        @/item
      @/stack
    @/cell
  @/grid
@/layout

---

## 2. Native Vector Graphics Engine (Phase 7)

@vector width=800 height=320 viewBox="0 0 800 320" background="#111318" theme="dark"
gradient id="heroGlow" type="radial" cx=0.5 cy=0.5 r=0.8
  stop offset=0 color="rgba(124,92,255,0.35)"
  stop offset=1 color="rgba(124,92,255,0)"
@endgradient

artboard id="main" x=0 y=0 w=800 h=320
  layer id="background"
    rect x=0 y=0 w=800 h=320 fill="#111318"
    circle cx=400 cy=160 r=140 fill="gradient:heroGlow"
  @endlayer
  layer id="content"
    group id="card" transform="translate(200, 60)"
      rect id="panel" x=0 y=0 w=400 h=200 radius=20 fill="#1a1f2b" stroke="#2d3648" strokeWidth=2
      circle id="avatar" cx=60 cy=60 r=24 fill="#7c5cff"
      text id="title" x=100 y=52 size=22 fill="#ffffff"
        Native Vector Graphics
      @endtext
      text id="body" x=100 y=88 size=14 fill="#a8b0c2" w=260 wrap=true
        Declarative vector language with scene graph, transforms, shapes, Bezier curves, and SVG export.
      @endtext
    @endgroup
  @endlayer
@endartboard
@/vector

---

## 3. Native Component, Template & Macro System (Phase 9)

component Alert(tone="info", title="")
card variant=tone
### {title}
slot
end
end

macro note(text)
info
{text}
end

Alert(tone="warning", title="Component System")
Components, templates, and macros allow authors to define content abstractions once and reuse them across documents.
end

note("This note was expanded via a Zolto Phase 9 macro.")

---

## 4. Interactive Documents & Educational Features (Phase 10)

@quiz "Zolto Knowledge Check" {
  @mcq "What is Zolto's primary design goal?" {
    @correct "Zero-dependency Markdown superset with native rich media"
    @choice "Heavy framework with npm dependencies"
    @choice "CSS-only preprocessor"
  }

  @truefalse "Zolto supports native math equations without KaTeX."
  answer true

  @blank "Capital of France"
  answer "Paris"
}

@deck ZoltoCore {
  @card
    front "Phase 7"
    back "Native Vector Graphics Engine"
  @end
  @card
    front "Phase 9"
    back "Component, Template & Macro System"
  @end
  @card
    front "Phase 10"
    back "Interactive Documents & Educational Features"
  @end
}

@poll "Which Zolto phase is your favorite?" {
  Phase 7 — Vector Engine
  Phase 8 — Spatial Layout
  Phase 9 — Components & Macros
  Phase 10 — Interactive Documents
}

