## 9. Callouts & Admonitions (Phases 2-3)

> [!TIP]
> Zolto is a high-performance document engine supporting native math, diagrams, charts, vectors, spatial layouts, components, and interactive widgets.

[info title="Zolto Engine Info"]
100% backward compatible with CommonMark and GitHub Flavored Markdown.
[/info]

---

## 10. Definition List & Code Metadata

```javascript title="app.js" {2} numbers
import { compile } from 'zolto';
const html = compile(zoltoSourceStr);
console.log(html);
```

Component System
: Declarative `component`, `template`, `macro`, `slot`, `fill` constructs with typed props and scoped evaluation.

Interactive Documents
: Declarative `@form`, `@quiz`, `@deck`, `@poll`, `@tasks`, `@state`, `@shared` blocks compiling to accessible HTML.
